OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBecoming
OL,6,Fcloudier overnight as a band of rain,
OL,7,Fheavy at times moves across the region
OL,8,Ffrom midnight. Winds will gradually
OL,9,Fease through the course of the night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FA mild and wet start, skies
OL,12,Fslowly clearing from the north from
OL,13,Flate morning. Chance of some showers
OL,14,Fdeveloping during the afternoon along
OL,15,Fthe Kent coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
